   :id "C15/facet/3203-3834",
   :document-id "C15",
   :independent-facet-acceptance :pending,
   :predicate
   "Phase availability is a complete conjunction: explicit nil keys until produced, actual source-span variants/origins/related locations, no invented module/coordinates/meta-JVM context, explicit unavailable system-error inputs, and no unresolved/private construction record published as a resolved safe diagnostic."}
